<p>Ay naserane Aza tum ho fatima ki dua,<br />
Sadae haye hussaina bapa karo harja,</p>

<p>
1) bahao Ashke aza fatima ko do pursa,<br />
Karo hussain ka matam Suna k yeh noha.</p>

<p>
2) Kiya wo noha shahedee'n ne laashe Ghazi par,<br />
Ke jisko sunke sitamgar bhi karrahe the buka.</p>

<p>
3) ye bain karte hai kouno makaa'n me jinno bashar,<br />
Bulake dhoke se Aada ne sheh ko Qatl kiya.</p>

<p>
4) Ajeeb tarha ki shadi rachi hai karbal me,<br />
Hai pyase dulha dulhan aur Barati aale aba.</p>

<p>
5) Na tha layeno'n me kya koi sahebe aulaad,<br />
Sawale Aab pa Asghar ko teer se maara.</p>

<p>
6) tumhare sar pa hai Qayam Imam ka saya,<br />
Khosha naseeb ke tumko hai bawafa ki aata.</p>

<p>
7) Ye naseraane Aza ki sadaye hai moula,<br />
Fazai karbobala me sunaye yeh Noha <br />
</p>